        "Title": "Lucy&apos;s Lament",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127765754976",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 76093a1e-fc60-4207-ae0c-91a2b6c4f226).Image",
        "Description": "Artist Lucy Phillips has been waiting for her big break for a long time, and now she finally has the chance she&apos;s been waiting for - the grand opening of the Burj Al-Ghazali! People will be talking about this for years and will completely make her career!\r\r Or at least, they should have been if her staff would have figured out the electrical issues. Sure water and electricity is a dangerous combination, but any competent team could have waterproofed it.\r\r  Show her staff the price of failure.",
